    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though we've already made it to the exit...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you really think we'd let you just stroll out of Chernobog?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you think it's about time for someone to wake you from your daydream?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our commmunications have been restored, and I've contact O.P.D. They'll be joining up with us shortly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, this blasted...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch out, she's holding onto explosives!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
