        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still can't get in touch with the recon team!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Who exactly are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't expect you to know who I am...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I know that person next to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Reunion... going to continue fighting us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, hey, don't be like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no love for that she-dragon, Talulah. I'm not even cut out for this goaltending business. It's a pain to have to rush over here after a long day of work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "So for the sake of future cooperation, why don't we exchange some pleasantries first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may simply call me... W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've waited a long time to see that person next to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr.{@Nickname}......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a few little questions I'd like to ask {@Nickname}. Would you be so kind as to give us some... alone time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wasting your breath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#8",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "--Don't be so hasty. I have some information you might be interested in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, we just met some rather slick fellows... Quite skilled, and dressed just like you guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though their camouflage might have been enough to fool Ursus, I saw right through their little trick~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Could they be from the recon team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad... that they're safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Little bunny, are you their leader?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm quite curious, what charm do you hold over them... so that they'd give their lives so enthusiastically and unremorsefully for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What... are you saying...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "You heard me. None of them... will be returning to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you really... worth sacrificing their lives over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_bat_game02_intro",
        "key": "$m_bat_game02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Don't worry about her. The exit's right there!;Amiya...;What's the point of you doing this, W?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not done talking yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Did I make you mad?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "... You've gone too far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, good... Now that's more like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "W of the Reunion Movement, you've gone too far!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every life is precious, each and every one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is something that you'll never tarnish!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Rhodes Island, prepare for combat!",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
